Hi Bilal,
>> Thanks for your previous help. Sorry to bother you again. I have few 
>> other questions that I need help with respect to Zelig.
>>
>> 1. I am trying to use e.i. R into C in order to calculate quantities 
>> of interest at precinct level. I tried
>>
>> s.out$qi$ev
>>
>> but I got the simulation results instead of precinct level results I 
>> believe. How can I get precinct level results in e.i. R into C along 
