You are right. The original EI model (Rosen, Jiang, King, and Tanner)  
does not directly yield precinct-level estimates of the vote fractions. 
We tried to calculate them
via simulation in Zelig, but from a discussion with the authors a while 
back, that wasn't the correct way of doing it. We are looking into 
alternative solutions. Sorry for the inconvenience.

Thanks,
Ferdi

